<title>USA: NextHealth Inc reports first quarter loss.</title>
<headline>NextHealth Inc reports first quarter loss.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>NextHealth Inc said its company experienced a net loss for the quarter of $634,632, or $0.07 per share, which is less than the net loss of $2,836,422, or $0.33 per share for the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it earned a profit in March of 1997, its first profitable month since January 1995.</p>
<p>Total net revenue for the quarter ended March 31, 1997, rose about 25 percent to $5.8 million versus the same period in 1996.</p>
</text>
